title: 'Registrar: add lock and unlock'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      `pallet-registrar-para::add_lock` shuts the manager out of a registered para; `remove_lock`
      lifts it, for root or the para itself only. Both emit an event, where the relay chain's lock
      was silent. `ParaInfo` grows a `locked` flag, and a new `ParachainOrigin` config type lets a
      para act as itself.

crates:
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
